<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12870" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-κλύζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wash off,</i> [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίσσαν] εἰς οἶνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Erasistr.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Philum.
				<u>Ven.</u>
				17.12
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν λόγον ἀ. τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cic.</u>
					32
				</span></i>
			; <i>wash clean,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σέρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					32.1
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PHolm.</u>
					27.2
				</span></i>
			; <i>rinse</i> the mouth, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				14.17.5
			</span></i>:— 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.6.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mu.</u>
				397a34
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in 
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				4.51
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτίμφ λόγῳ ἀλμυρὰν ἀκοὴν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					243d
				</span></i>
			: hence, <i>avert by purifications,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄνειρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					1340
				</span></i>
			.</div>
